<item>
  <title>KG-DWN-98/2 Subsea Development</title>
  <link>https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/kg-dwn-982-subsea-development</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/kg-dwn-982-subsea-development" hreflang="en"&gt;KG-DWN-98/2 Subsea Development&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;div class="field field--name-field-project-metrics field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;984 to 4,921 feet&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;water depth&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;5 locations&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;engineering executed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
  


  &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-highlights field--type-text-long field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Highlights&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;India's largest integrated subsea development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Executing the engineering, procurement, construction, installation, and pre-commissioning of subsea umbilicals, risers and flowlines (SURF) at water depths between 984 feet (300 meters) and 4,921 feet (1,500 meters)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;When completed the project is expected to contribute 7% to the country's overall natural gas output following the start of hydrocarbon production in its KG-DWN-98/2 block - a major boost to energy security&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-project-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The integrated subsea package includes the supply of all subsea production systems (SPS), including deepwater trees, and the installation of pipelines, subsea umbilicals, risers and flowlines (SURF). First gas was achieved in March 2020, followed by the completion of the partial gas system in September 2021. In January 2024, first oil was also achieved.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-solutions-category field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Subsea Field Development&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-spotlight-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;  &lt;img loading="eager" src="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/sites/default/files/styles/webp/public/2024-10/KG-DWN.png.webp?itok=fLGBCQKN" width="864" height="576" alt="KG-DWN-98/2 Subsea Development" class="image-style-webp"&gt;


&lt;/div&gt;
      
  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-location field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Location&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;East Coast of India&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-scope field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Scope&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;EPCI &amp;amp; Pre-commissioning&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
</description>
